{"model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","input":["River survey cooler RS-12 contains the north-bank water samples.","Cooler RS-12 is handed from the boat crew to the lab courier at marker 6.","The custody seal for cooler RS-12 is recorded as seal RIV-904.","river survey sample custody: the south-bank sediment bags use another accession range.","river survey sample custody: the survey boat stores a separate oar inspection card.","river survey sample custody: the lab freezer keeps an unrelated rack map.","river survey sample custody: the river gauge reports a different water level.","river survey sample custody: the field tablet carries another charging cable.","river survey sample custody: the permit folder contains an unrelated sampling waiver.","river survey sample custody: the wader kit is dried on a separate rack.","river survey sample custody: the drone case holds another flight battery.","river survey sample custody: the sample labels are printed for a different tributary.","river survey sample custody: the courier van follows another laboratory route.","river survey sample custody: the shoreline camera uses a separate memory card.","river survey sample custody: the field team posts an unrelated weather note.","river survey sample custody: the ice machine receives another maintenance visit."],"truncate":false}